"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5286800","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3077540-1846651706690028","game_id":"steam-3077540","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Live!","summary":"We have been waiting a long time for this day. The Love: Fall in Death demo is now live during Steam Next Fest, and it's free.The demo is a slice of the game's first chapter. Kutay, Batu and Gökhan are hanging out at a bar when Ayşil walks in, and before they know it the three of them have made a bet about her. What happens after that is up to you.Then there are the dice. At key moments you roll, just like in a tabletop RPG. You might pick the right answer, but if the roll doesn't go your way, t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:37:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690028","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3077540-1846651706686293","game_id":"steam-3077540","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Results Are In: What We're Fixing","summary":"The free demo of Love: Fall in Death opens tomorrow, October 19, as part of Steam Next Fest, and we could not be more excited to finally let you go on your first date.Over the past weeks our first playtesters went through the demo, and the feedback has been incredibly helpful. Players laughed, screamed, failed a few dice rolls and told us exactly where the experience could be better. We have been working through that list ever since.Already fixedVoice acting and subtitle issues reported in some ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:36:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686293","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:54Z","discove